o esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/5897983.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video></div><dl class="lux-seo-facts"><div><dt>Product Type</dt><dd>Seasoning Oil</dd></div><div><dt>Ingredients</dt><dd>Olive oil and flavouring.</dd></div><div><dt>Allergen Advice</dt><dd>Suitable for all consumers except those allergic or intolerant to any ingredient.</dd></div><div><dt>Country of Origin</dt><dd>Italy</dd></div><div><dt>Importer</dt><dd>LuxurEat (Shanghai) Trading Co., Ltd.</dd></div><div><dt>Importer Address</dt><dd>Room 5312, No. 19, Lane 38, Caoli Road, Fengjing Town, Jinshan District, Shanghai</dd></div><div><dt>Storage</dt><dd>Store away from light and heat.</dd></div><div><dt>Overseas Producer Registration</dt><dd>CITA06022511070074</dd></div><div><dt>Nutrition Information</dt><dd>Per 100 ml: energy 3379 kJ, protein 0 g, fat 91.3 g, carbohydrate 0 g, sugars 0 g, dietary fibre 0 g, sodium 500 mg.</dd></div></dl></section><section class="lux-reader-section lux-product-story-media"><h2>Product Information</h2><p>White-truffle-flavoured oil made with olive oil and flavouring, with the oil providing a soft base for the truffle aroma. It is intended for the finishing stage of a dish and works with pasta, risotto, eggs, potatoes and cold plates.</p><p>Drizzle a small amount over the dish or fold it into a sauce so the aroma blends with the ingredients; it is better suited to finishing than prolonged high-heat cooking. Format: 60 ml.</p><div class="lux-product-videos" aria-label="Product videos"><video data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline preload="none" poster="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/appennino/white-truffle-oil-60ml.webp'); ?>" aria-label="Olio aromatizzato al tartufo bianco · 60 ml video 1"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/33460121.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline preload="none" poster="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/appennino/white-truffle-oil-60ml.webp'); ?>" aria-label="Olio aromatizzato al tartufo bianco · 60 ml video 2"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/4109923.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="lux-product-video-notes"><p>Truffle aroma is best introduced at the final stage. Turn off the heat, let the dish retain its warmth, then add a small amount and fold it through gently, or drizzle it over the surface.</p><p>Let the ingredients develop their own flavour first, then use a small amount of seasoning oil to finish. The ingredients and oil come first on the palate, followed by the truffle aroma, so the dish stays clear without complicated seasoning.</p></div><div class="lux-product-storage-gallery"><picture><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/oil-01-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/oil-01.webp'); ?>" alt="Olio aromatizzato al tartufo bianco · 60 ml · Serving inspiration 1"></picture><picture><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/oil-02-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/oil-02.webp'); ?>" alt="Olio aromatizzato al tartufo bianco · 60 ml · Serving inspiration 2"></picture><picture><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/oil-03-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/oil-03.webp'); ?>" alt="Olio aromatizzato al tartufo bianco · 60 ml · Serving inspiration 3"></picture><picture><source media="(max-width: 720px)" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/oil-04-mobile.webp'); ?>"><img width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/storage/oil-04.webp'); ?>" alt="Olio aromatizzato al tartufo bianco · 60 ml · Serving inspiration 4"></picture></div><div class="lux-product-storage-notes"><p>Store away from light and heat. Take the amount needed for use, close the cap promptly after pouring, and keep the bottle opening clean. After opening, continue to store the oil in the same way. It can be added in a small amount once the dish is finished.</p></div></section></div></section></article></main>
